      "ea": "0x4e490",
      "comment": "Raw queue credit: passed R0 is saved in R8 (0x4E440); this dword store increments that state+0x111D0 for type>8, excluding16/17, HP0. This is the credit reset/consumed by queue code, not a separate mission total."
    },
    {
      "ea": "0x541dc",
      "comment": "Raw dword reset of queue credit at state+0x111D0. Its increment in Tact_KillUnit also uses dword access. Consume at0x54780 reads only the low halfword."
    },
    {
      "ea": "0x54780",
      "comment": "Raw LDRH reads low16 of queue credit at state+0x111D0; add to Soldier.uKills then STRH at0x54788. The owned credit cell is32 bits because increment and resets are dword."
    },
    {
      "ea": "0x54790",
      "comment": "Raw dword clear of queue credit at state+0x111D0 after its low halfword was added to Soldier.uKills. Do not preserve an independent high-half field."
